OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to convert part of pub into
OL,4,Aholiday let
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been submitted to turn part
OL,7,Fof a pub into self-catered tourist
OL,8,Faccommodation.
OL,10,FIf approved, part of the Saint Lawrence
OL,11,FPub would be converted into a holiday
OL,12,Flet.
OL,14,FIn its planning statement, Socrates
OL,15,FArchitects said: "The proposal is
OL,16,Ffundamentally about retaining and
OL,17,Fsecuring the future of the pub, rather
OL,18,Fthan replacing it."
